<title>UK: Britain's PIA appoints new director.</title>
<headline>Britain's PIA appoints new director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Personal Investment Authority (PIA) said on Wednesday that Roger Sanders had joined its board as a director.</p>
<p>Sanders, who is principal of independent financial advisers Roger Sanders Associates and has nearly 30 years experience of the financial services industry, will fill the practitioner director vacancy on the PIA's board.</p>
<p>He will also become chairman of its Small Business Practitioners Panel.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
